    {
      "timestamp": "2026-03-14T17:08:11.382Z",
      "type": "designPhilosophy",
      "content": "What if every player mattered? Like, actually mattered?\n\nOur monetization promise:\n\n✅ Buy once, play forever\n✅ All content available to all players\n✅ No psychological manipulation\n✅ No pay-to-win mechanics\n\nIf we make DLC, it's meaningful expansion.\nNot extraction.\n\nPlayers over profits.\n\n#IndieGameDev #GameDev #EthicalGaming",
      "hook": "What if every player mattered? Like, actually mattered?",
      "theme": "Respectful Monetization",
